Package: fastmed
Type: Package
Title: Mediation Analysis with Selected Column Prefixes Using Parallel Processing
Version: 0.2.0
Date: 2025-12-27
Authors@R: person("Daehwan", "Kim", email = "kdh5358@snu.ac.kr", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Author: Daehwan Kim [aut, cre, cph]
Maintainer: Daehwan Kim <kdh5358@snu.ac.kr>
Description: Performs batch mediation analysis using generalized linear models
    (Gaussian/Binomial/Poisson) and either quasi-Bayesian (asymptotic)
    simulation or bootstrap resampling. Allows customization of column prefixes
    and uses parallel processing for efficiency.
URL: https://github.com/daehwankim12/fastmed
